      <div xml:id="pl-l2d2c6">
        <head xml:id="pl-l2d2c6-Hd1e108">Capitulum 6</head>
        <head xml:id="pl-l2d2c6-Hd1e110" type="questionTitle">Quomodo dixerit Lucifer: Ascendam in caelum</head>
        <p xml:id="pl-l2d2c6-d1e113">Hic quaeri solet, si in empyreo caelo fuerunt Angeli statim 
          quam facti sunt, quomodo legitur in <title ref="#is">Isaia</title>: Dicit <name xml:id="pl-l2d2c6-Nd1e118">Lucifer</name>: 
          <cit>
            <quote xml:id="pl-l2d2c6-Qd1e122" source="http://scta.info/resource/is14_13">Ascendam in caelum et exaltabo solium meum, et ero similis 
              Altissimo.</quote>
            <bibl>Isaias 14:13</bibl>
          </cit>
        </p>
        <p xml:id="pl-l2d2c6-d1e129">Sed ibi vocat <mentioned>caelum</mentioned> Dei celsitudinem, cui parificari volebat; 
          et est tale: <mentioned>Ascendam in caelum</mentioned>, id est ad aequalitatem Dei.</p>
      </div>
    </body>
